Package: easyactions
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://github.com/Mask-AI-FR/EasyAction
Description: Run GitHub Actions across a whole organization
 EasyActions is a dashboard for GitHub Actions. Pick an organization, see every
 repository with its branches and workflows and their live status, trigger
 workflow_dispatch runs in bulk, and read pipeline and commit statistics.
 .
 The package installs a self-contained server and opens it in its own window.
 Each user gets their own database under ~/.local/share/easyactions.
